  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 960224,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": " for## 180 Demo: A Darts Challenge for the Commodore 64\n\nStep up to the oche in *180 Demo*, a fast-paced darts simulation for the Commodore 64! This isn't just about throwing darts; it's about conquering a championship tournament. Face off against a field of skilled opponents in a classic 501 darts format – subtract your score from 501 and finish on a double to claim victory.\n\nProgress through the tournament, starting at the quarter finals where you'll need to win best-of-three matches to advance. Triumph in the semi-finals to reach the ultimate showdown: a final leg against the formidable World Champion, \"Jammy Jim.\" One leg is all you need to claim the title!\n\nBeyond the tournament, *180 Demo* offers exciting multiplayer options. Challenge a friend in head-to-head play or test your skills in the frantic \"Round the Clock\" mode, hitting every number on the dartboard from 20 to 1 against the clock. Hone your aim and prove you're the ultimate darts champion!"
    },
